    B -->|Forensics| E[Forensics]
    B -->|Reversing| F[Reverse Engineering]
    B -->|Misc| G[Miscellaneous]
    
    C --> H[Enumerate & Scan]
    D --> H
    E --> H
    F --> H
    G --> H
    
    H --> I[Find Vulnerability]
    I --> J{Exploit Successful?}
